    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay that makes sense. i definitely use it basically every day for work. does that mean i can just write off the whole thing at once, or is there some rule about how i have to spread out the cost of big stuff like furniture over a few years?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
