      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "QuickBooks allows you to depreciate the cost of long-lasting assets, including furniture, over a few years. This is called depreciation or amortization. For a business asset like an ergonomic chair, you might be able to depreciate it over 3-5 years, depending on its useful life and yourCompany's accounting methods. This can help you spread out the annual expense and reduce your taxable income.",
